    blurb: "One of the most successful light turbine helicopters.",
    body: "The Bell 206 JetRanger became a fixture of news, police, charter, and training flying thanks to its reliable turbine engine and graceful handling. Its sleek shape is one of the most recognizable in civil helicopter aviation.",
